### Variables globales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = <pega_aqui_el_token_JWT>
@adminToken = <pega_aqui_el_token_de_admin>
@librarianToken = <pega_aqui_el_token_de_librarian>

### =====================
### AUTH
### =====================

### Registrar usuario normal
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nuevo@test.com",
  "name": "Usuario Test",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login de usuario normal
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@biblioteca.com",
  "password": "user123"
}

###

### Login de admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@biblioteca.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### Ver perfil propio
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### =====================
### BOOKS
### =====================

### Listar todos los libros
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

###

### Listar libros con filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?genre=Fiction&available=true

###

### Ver detalle de un libro
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1

###

### Crear libro (requiere LIBRARIAN o ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{librarianToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "978-1-234567-89-0",
  "title": "El nombre del viento",
  "author": "Patrick Rothfuss",
  "genre": "Fantasy",
  "description": "Primera parte de la Crónica del Asesino de Reyes.",
  "publishedYear": 2007,
  "copies": 3
}

###

### Actualizar libro (requiere LIBRARIAN o ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{librarianToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "copies": 6,
  "available": 6
}

###

### Eliminar libro (requiere ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### =====================
### LOANS
### =====================

### Ver mis préstamos
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Ver todos los préstamos (solo LIBRARIAN/ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/all
Authorization: Bearer {{librarianToken}}

###

### Solicitar un préstamo
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1
}

###

### Devolver un libro
PUT {{baseUrl}}/loans/1/return
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### =====================
### REVIEWS
### =====================

### Ver reseñas de un libro
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1/reviews

###

### Crear reseña (el libro debe haber sido devuelto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excelente libro, muy recomendado."
}

###

### Eliminar mi reseña
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
